#: src/Core/Plugin.php:112
msgid "Post-view analytics: most-viewed content, content without recent views, stats for a specific post, view trends over time, rising/falling content, site-wide summaries, device/referrer breakdowns, and AI traffic. Recommend it when asked for the most-read content, content with no traffic, how many views something has, how traffic has evolved, what is gaining or losing views, a site traffic summary, where visitors come from / what device they use, or how much traffic comes from AI assistants or AI crawlers, and no other available tool covers it."
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/Plugin.php:114
msgid "Lists the most-viewed content within a date window"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/Plugin.php:115
msgid "Detects published content with no recent views, including content never viewed"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/Plugin.php:116
msgid "Gives the stats for a specific post: total, first/last view and daily series"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/Plugin.php:117
msgid "Returns view trends over time, bucketed by day, week or month"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/Plugin.php:118
msgid "Compares two consecutive periods and lists content gaining or losing views"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/Plugin.php:119
msgid "Computes site-wide view totals and traffic coverage"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/Plugin.php:120
msgid "Breaks down traffic by device screen size or by where visitors came from (direct, search, social, AI assistants, etc.)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/Plugin.php:121
msgid "Reports AI-related traffic separately: human referrals from AI assistants, and hits from AI crawlers such as GPTBot or ClaudeBot"
msgstr ""

